# Build context excludes for the container image (Dockerfile at repo root).
# Defense in depth: none of these should ever reach the build context, let
# alone the image, but the .dockerignore is a second gate alongside .gitignore.

.git
.superpowers
docs

# Python virtualenvs and caches — the image installs the API fresh via pip.
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__

# Node deps and build output — the image runs its own `npm ci` + build.
**/node_modules

# Local state, ledgers, and secrets that must never be baked into an image.
**/*.db
**/*.local.yaml
**/*.pem
